{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 0, "text_idx": 4, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 115, "letters": 433, "chars": 577, "max_new_tokens": 844, "t_start": 1790298304.713, "latency": 21.393, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1478532, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "a203bb22405b42d092ca2a45f6dc8d83", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "34", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "14.7", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "182.5", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "21155.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "385", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "146", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "844", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "984", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "off", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 844}, "params": {}, "text": "I stood on top of the tower last night, the very top, and I looked out over the whole city. The lights. Millions of lights, as far as you can see. And I thought, wow. Just, wow. When I was a young man, I used to look at these buildings from across the river, and I'd say, someday. Someday. And now, here I am, standing on top of one of them, and it's so quiet up there. So quiet. You can see the clouds moving. It's the most magnificent thing I've ever seen. Truly magnificent. I stayed up there for an hour. Nobody said a word. Sometimes you just have to stand there and look.", "audio_s": 30.8, "rtf": 0.695, "s_per_word": 0.268, "s_per_letter": 0.0711, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 1.016, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "748fca6dcec770e4249fc5e30ff2f3995f010f68608dd0ed48cb0e28b7f59408", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/000.wav"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 1, "text_idx": 5, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 120, "letters": 507, "chars": 662, "max_new_tokens": 984, "t_start": 1790298304.715, "latency": 21.399, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1524612, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "78c1f0f224f54f6c9fb46f67285403db", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "34", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "3.3", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "182.5", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "21155.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "397", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "157", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "984", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "984", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "off", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 984}, "params": {}, "text": "You know, I had the number one show on television. Number one. The ratings were through the roof, higher than anybody. And every year they had the big awards, and every year, who won? Not me. Some show nobody ever watched. Nobody! I'd sit there in the front row, smiling, clapping, and they'd give it to somebody else. Every single year. It was rigged, folks. It was a rigged system, and everybody knew it. But that's okay. That's okay. I don't need their little trophy. I have much bigger things now. Much bigger. But I remember. I always remember. They still send me an invitation every year. Every single year. And every year, I throw it right in the garbage.", "audio_s": 31.76, "rtf": 0.674, "s_per_word": 0.265, "s_per_letter": 0.0626, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.895, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "391610fbfb8dbf82b2dd34d1f4f9e10d697c6531d53e5074b468da681a03d74a", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/001.wav"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 2, "text_idx": 6, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 121, "letters": 458, "chars": 619, "max_new_tokens": 891, "t_start": 1790298304.716, "latency": 21.408, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1344132, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "46492298144646bf835f46e8bd7cb34a", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "34", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "3.0", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "182.5", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "21155.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "350", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "162", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "891", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "984", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "off", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 891}, "params": {}, "text": "So they hand me this new phone, and they say, sir, it's very easy, all your pictures are in the cloud. The cloud? What cloud? I looked up, there's no cloud. It was a beautiful day. And they say, no, sir, it's not that kind of cloud, it's a digital cloud. A digital cloud. Okay. So where is it? Nobody knows! It's somewhere. It's floating around. And I said, well, if it's floating, can it rain on my pictures? And they looked at me, and they didn't know. Nobody knows how it works. I don't think they know. And then they told me the cloud is actually in a big building somewhere in the desert. So it's not even a cloud!", "audio_s": 28.0, "rtf": 0.765, "s_per_word": 0.231, "s_per_letter": 0.0611, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.873, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "a4130d96d6c2f155390ecaaf889e54c5fe12acc32a8543a7a74981528b922c72", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/002.wav"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 3, "text_idx": 7, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 124, "letters": 488, "chars": 645, "max_new_tokens": 948, "t_start": 1790298304.718, "latency": 21.401, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1582212, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "62ea235089984baba1b45350fd579d63", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "34", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "3.2", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "182.5", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "21155.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "412", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "158", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "948", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "984", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "off", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 948}, "params": {}, "text": "Sometimes, late at night, I sit out on the terrace and I look at the ocean, and I think about things. Big things. What does it all mean? What's the secret to a great deal? And you know what I've come to realize? It's not the money. Everybody thinks it's the money. It's the timing. It's knowing when to walk away, and knowing when to stay at the table. Maybe life is like that too. Maybe life is one very long negotiation. I don't know. I think about it a lot. More than people would think. Maybe the ocean knows. It's been around a long time, longer than me, believe it or not. It doesn't negotiate. It just keeps coming back, every single day.", "audio_s": 32.96, "rtf": 0.649, "s_per_word": 0.266, "s_per_letter": 0.0675, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.965, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "c315f4efafbf98780256ceaf79f8f8bee9b933485032ca555b4ab1945a918395", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/003.wav"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 4, "text_idx": 8, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 115, "letters": 455, "chars": 602, "max_new_tokens": 885, "t_start": 1790298304.72, "latency": 21.409, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1493892, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "3b4b3225a2b44495baad0fb831f86aea", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "34", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "2.6", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "182.5", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "21155.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "389", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "152", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "885", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "984", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "off", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 885}, "params": {}, "text": "You know what makes me happy? Honestly? It's the simple things. Long day, a lot of meetings, a lot of phone calls, big decisions. And then at the end of it, I sit down in my favorite chair, and somebody brings me a nice cheeseburger and a cold Diet Coke. Beautiful. The ketchup, the pickles, perfect. And I just sit there, and I watch a little television, and I think, this is good. This is really good. People think you need a lot to be happy. You don't. A good burger, a good chair. That's it. That's the whole secret. Maybe some ice cream later. Two scoops. Everybody else gets one scoop, I get two.", "audio_s": 31.12, "rtf": 0.688, "s_per_word": 0.271, "s_per_letter": 0.0684, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.977, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "27a2f30e5a915bd24e13310cad68cd511d382b146bf3ff59e5f4653f40b47812", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/004.wav"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 5, "text_idx": 9, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 118, "letters": 470, "chars": 626, "max_new_tokens": 914, "t_start": 1790298304.722, "latency": 21.4, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1497732, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "327a89f5091f4ae196e6d7314ce28e63", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "34", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "3.0", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "182.5", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "21155.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "390", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "158", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "914", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "984", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "off", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 914}, "params": {}, "text": "They told me it couldn't be done. They said, you'll never build a golf course on that land, it's too rocky, too windy, too everything. And I said, watch me. Watch me. We brought in the best people, the best builders, the best grass, the greenest grass you've ever seen. We worked day and night, through the rain, through the wind. And we did not stop. We never stop. And today, it's one of the greatest courses in the world. So when somebody tells me something is impossible, I don't hear impossible. I hear, let's get to work. That's how we do it. That's how we've always done it, and that's how we're going to keep doing it.", "audio_s": 31.2, "rtf": 0.686, "s_per_word": 0.264, "s_per_letter": 0.0664, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.948, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "137173bff6702ed623c32c68ffbf1d37bf3fa01278c9fc43b44cb7b5fb98a03e", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/005.wav"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 6, "text_idx": 10, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 116, "letters": 450, "chars": 598, "max_new_tokens": 876, "t_start": 1790298304.724, "latency": 21.403, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1470852, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "5ba5c126167c4cf6ae8b334a2fe4f887", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "34", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "2.6", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "182.5", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "21155.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "383", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "152", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "876", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "984", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "off", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 876}, "params": {}, "text": "So I get on this old airplane, they say it's a very important airplane, and I walk in, and the carpet, I'm telling you, the carpet was from nineteen seventy. Sticky. Your shoes stick to it. And there's a smell, I don't even want to describe the smell. Like old cheese and jet fuel. And they hand me a sandwich, it's wrapped in plastic, and the bread is gray. Gray bread! Who eats gray bread? I said, get this away from me. Get it away. I wouldn't feed that sandwich to a seagull. Terrible. Just terrible. Then I went to wash my hands, and the soap was green. Old green soap. I didn't even touch it.", "audio_s": 30.64, "rtf": 0.699, "s_per_word": 0.264, "s_per_letter": 0.0681, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 0.973, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "c97d1477ccf12ab8ee3708c3e3040fbfe79c6e7e597c24c3000146161426036a", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/006.wav"}
{"run": "trump_xlong_c8_n8_nonstream_inline", "tag": "", "voice": "trump", "lang": "en", "size": "xlong", "c": 8, "idx": 7, "text_idx": 11, "take": 0, "seed": null, "prompt_id": null, "voice_mode": "inline", "engine_voice": null, "ref_nonce": null, "words": 113, "letters": 464, "chars": 611, "max_new_tokens": 902, "t_start": 1790298304.726, "latency": 21.405, "ttfb": null, "ttfa": null, "status": 200, "error": null, "bytes": 1563012, "out_tokens": null, "resp_headers": {"x-request-id": "839290995c4f4c2d8ddda7659389301e", "x-ai-generated": "true", "x-baseline-batch-size": "8", "x-baseline-batch-id": "34", "x-baseline-queue-ms": "0.1", "x-baseline-prompt-ms": "182.5", "x-baseline-gen-ms": "21155.8", "x-baseline-codec-frames": "407", "x-baseline-text-tokens": "150", "x-baseline-max-new-tokens": "902", "x-baseline-batch-max-new-tokens": "984", "x-baseline-finish-reason": "stop", "x-baseline-prompt-cache": "off", "x-baseline-retries": "0", "x-baseline-sample-rate": "24000"}, "request": {"task_type": "Base", "response_format": "wav", "language": "English", "extra_params": {"temperature": 0.9, "top_k": 50}, "max_new_tokens": 902}, "params": {}, "text": "We did it! We won! Eighteenth hole, the whole club watching, I'm down by one stroke, and I hit the most beautiful shot of my life. The ball goes up, up, up, lands on the green, rolls, rolls, and goes right in! Right in the cup! Everybody went crazy! People were jumping, people were screaming, grown men were hugging each other! I've won a lot of things in my life, a lot of things, but this, this was incredible. Club champion again! Best feeling in the world, folks. The best feeling in the whole world! I've never been so happy. I want to do it again tomorrow. Let's play again tomorrow! Everybody's invited!", "audio_s": 32.56, "rtf": 0.657, "s_per_word": 0.288, "s_per_letter": 0.0702, "pace": 0.07, "pace_source": "file", "pace_ratio": 1.002, "suspect_reason": null, "pcm_sha256": "11f116901cdd69c737a82436b96d4107eb48f5d08595258eeff09e77b2124c7f", "suspect": false, "file": "audio/007.wav"}
